<p></p>



<p>AFRM I traded both those two early EPs, the first was a partnership with AMZN and the second was earnings, both stopped me out for decent losses and now look where the stock is. Frustrating.</p>



<figure class="wp-block-image size-large"><img decoding="async" width="1024" height="976" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201024%20976'%3E%3C/svg%3E" alt="" class="wp-image-463" data-lazy-srcset="https://qullamaggie.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/afrm-1024x976.png 1024w, https://qullamaggie.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/afrm-300x286.png 300w, https://qullamaggie.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/afrm-768x732.png 768w, https://qullamaggie.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/afrm.png 1314w" data-lazy-sizes="(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" data-lazy-src="https://qullamaggie.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/afrm-1024x976.png" /><noscript><img decoding="async" width="1024" height="976" src="wp-content/uploads/2021/11/afrm-1024x976.png" alt="" class="wp-image-463" srcset="wp-content/uploads/2021/11/afrm-1024x976.png 1024w, wp-content/uploads/2021/11/afrm-300x286.png 300w, wp-content/uploads/2021/11/afrm-768x732.png 768w, wp-content/uploads/2021/11/afrm.png 1314w" sizes="(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" /></noscript></figure>



<p>The beautiful part of this method is you find stocks that have a FUNDAMENTAL REASON to go up, stocks that have rocket fuel that can generate alpha for your portfolio. Look at the VXF chart below (or IWM if you so prefer) and you will see the majority of stocks went sideways during this period where these EPs made 50-100% moves post opening range highs.</p>



<figure class="wp-block-image size-large"><img decoding="async" width="1024" height="966" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201024%20966'%3E%3C/svg%3E" alt="" class="wp-image-464" data-lazy-srcset="https://qullamaggie.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/vxf-1024x966.png 1024w, https://qullamaggie.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/vxf-300x283.png 300w, https://qullamaggie.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/vxf-768x725.png 768w, https://qullamaggie.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/vxf.png 1316w" data-lazy-sizes="(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" data-lazy-src="https://qullamaggie.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/vxf-1024x966.png" /><noscript><img decoding="async" width="1024" height="966" src="wp-content/uploads/2021/11/vxf-1024x966.png" alt="" class="wp-image-464" srcset="wp-content/uploads/2021/11/vxf-1024x966.png 1024w, wp-content/uploads/2021/11/vxf-300x283.png 300w, wp-content/uploads/2021/11/vxf-768x725.png 768w, wp-content/uploads/2021/11/vxf.png 1316w" sizes="(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" /></noscript></figure>



<p></p>



<p>Now please refrain from questions about different variations or &#8220;what if it closes off the highs&#8221; or &#8220;what trailing stop is the best&#8221;. Whatever questions you have about this setup it&#8217;s your duty to find it out yourself by studying many hundreds of EPs. </p>



<p>Thanks and good luck!</p>



